# Roadmap Command

When the user asks to **add to the roadmap**, **update the roadmap**, or invokes the **Roadmap** command:

1. **Edit** `docs/content/roadmap/README.md` (or add a dated note there).
2. **Structure:** Keep sections concise. Add one line per idea.
3. **Format:** Short line of text per item. Use bold for the topic and a brief description.
4. **Do not** remove or reword existing items unless the user asks to. Only add or update what the user requested.
